        "PMC7513042::chunk::001::introduction::f13797f6f6"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is to add approximately 2–4 at.% Al during melting and casting.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 2–4 at.% Al will produce a thin, continuous, adherent Al2O3 surface scale on HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al has a high affinity for oxygen and will preferentially oxidize to Al2O3 in this alloy.",
